flowchart TD
    A[WordPress Request] --> B{Context?}
    B -- Editor 【Dashboard】 --> C[AdminKernel]
    C --> D[GutenbergBootstrapper]
    D --> E[Load all Jankx Blocks]
    E --> F[Register all blocks via BlockRegistry]
    F --> G[Gutenberg Editor: User can insert any Jankx block]

    B -- Frontend 【Public】 --> H[FrontendKernel]
    H --> I[GutenbergFrontendBootstrapper]
    I --> J[Parse post_content for used blocks]
    J --> K[Get list of used Jankx blocks]
    K --> L[Register only used blocks via BlockRegistry]
    L --> M[Apply Partial Hydration Settings]
    M --> N{First Block?}
    N -- Yes 【Always TRUE】 --> O[Partial Hydration: FALSE 【Server Render】]
    N -- No 【Check User Setting】 --> P{User Setting?}
    P -- TRUE 【Lazy Load】 --> Q[Partial Hydration: TRUE 【Lazy Load via AJAX】]
    P -- FALSE 【Server Render】 --> R[Partial Hydration: FALSE 【Server Render】]
    O --> S[Render via Server]
    Q --> T[Render placeholder, lazy load on scroll]
    R --> S
    T --> U[Load block content via AJAX when visible]

    B -- AJAX 【Gutenberg】 --> V[GutenbergAjaxKernel]
    V --> W[GutenbergAjaxBootstrapper]
    W --> X[Handle AJAX requests for block rendering]
    X --> Y[Return rendered HTML via AJAX]

    style C fill:#e0eaff
    style H fill:#e0eaff
    style V fill:#e0eaff
    style D fill:#b3e6b3
    style I fill:#b3e6b3
    style W fill:#b3e6b3
    style E fill:#ffe6cc
    style J fill:#ffe6cc
    style K fill:#ffe6cc
    style L fill:#ffe6cc
    style M fill:#ffe6cc
    style N fill:#ffe6cc
    style P fill:#ffe6cc
    style O fill:#d4edda
    style Q fill:#f8d7da
    style R fill:#d4edda
    style S fill:#cce5ff
    style T fill:#fff3cd
    style U fill:#fff3cd
    style X fill:#fff3cd
    style Y fill:#fff3cd
    style B fill:#d1ecf1
    style A fill:#d1ecf1